〈 AUTOMATIC RENEWAL 〉

Watalook is a paid service so you’ll need a subscription to use it;
• The payment will be charged to your selected payment method at confirmation of purchase and will be renewed every 30 calendar days ;
• The subscription renews automatically unless the auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period;
• Your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of your selected subscription;
• You can manage subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal after purchase by going to your App Store Account Settings;
• Any unused portion of Watalook’s free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when you purchase a subscription.

